    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auctĭfĭco</span></b> ,
			āre, v. a.
		auctus-facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to increase</i>, <i>enlarge;</i> in
			the lang. of sacrifice (like mactare and adolere), <i>to honor by offerings</i> (only in Arn.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cibis novis deos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 7, p. 224</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">honorem deorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			; so <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i> p. 223.</div>
